            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.8+ZEP.2.9+ZEP.2.10+ZEP.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jep 2.8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot Lubaŋa owaco kuman ni, “Jo Moab onoŋo yam guwacci, Nen, jo Juda doŋ gicalo jo me rok mukene-gu ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno abimiyo lweny poto i gaŋi murumo Moab ma gikuro waŋ lobo pa jo Moab-ni, kadi wa ki deyo me lobo Moab ma en aye Bet-jecimot, Baal-meon, ki Kiriataim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimiyo lobogi woko, kacel ki jo Ammon, bot jo ma tye wokceŋ me bedo megi, wek pe doŋ gipo i kome matwal i kin lurok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene abiŋolo kop i kom jo Moab. Man bimiyo giŋeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
